   "widgets_values": [
    "Korean webtoon panel, tight close-up, his face fills the frame from forehead to chin, slightly low angle.\n\nACTING (strong, instantly readable webtoon expression and body language): Expressionless: Jaemin watches in complete silence, his face utterly still, eyes cold, dark and unblinking, facing LEFT toward her; no smile, no satisfaction, no pity. Mouth closed.\n\nJaemin (the person in <image1>), seated in the armchair by the window, watches her without moving. Only his face and a little of his white collar: the warm floor lamp lights one side of his face and leaves the other half in deep shadow; dark blurred city lights behind him.\n\nHan Jaemin (28) wears: office outfit: white dress shirt with sleeves rolled to the forearm, open collar, no necktie, dark navy slacks, silver wristwatch.\n\nExactly 1 person in the panel, each appearing only once. No other people anywhere in the frame, not even small in the background.\n\nREFERENCES: <image1> is Han Jaemin (28)'s neutral bust portrait (identity only: same face, eyes, hairstyle and hair color). <image2> is the place, for the background colors and lighting only: this is a close-up, so only a small, softly blurred part of it shows behind the person. Do not draw the whole room. The person references only show who each person is. Do NOT copy their crop, plain background, outfit, pose or expression.\n\nART STYLE (identical in every image): high-quality Japanese anime key-visual style adapted for a Korean webtoon. Thin, clean, dark lineart with delicate hand-drawn weight variation. Soft cel shading with smooth gradient shadows and a gentle bloom; warm golden key light from one side with a soft rim light on hair and shoulders; airy, slightly muted colors with natural skin tones; subtle paper grain texture over the whole image. Eyes: large glossy anime eyes with layered iris color gradients, two or three bright highlights and fine individual upper and lower lashes, but with adult eye shapes (not round childlike eyes). Hair: luminous highlight bands, defined strand clumps and fine flyaway strands catching the light. Delicate pink blush hatching lines on the cheeks only when emotional. Adult faces with mature jawlines, realistic adult proportions, women with a natural medium-size chest. Not chibi, not 3D, not photorealistic, no plastic skin, no thick outlines, no text.\n\nOne single panel: no text, no speech bubbles, no sound effects, no panel border. Adults with realistic proportions. No necklaces on Jaemin or Seoa.\n\nFRAMING: this panel is a tall vertical 2:3 webtoon frame; compose the shot for a vertical frame.",
    "",
    1024
   ],
